msgstr "2"

#: tfrmpointerscannersettings.edtthreadstacks.hint
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Fill in the total number of threads that should be allowed to be used as a "
"stack lookup.\n"
"Thread 1 is usually the main thread of the game, but if that one spawns another "
"thread for game related events, you might want to have that secondary thread as "
"well.\n"
